    ]
  },
  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "People were mourning, helping one another and reviewing safety. Airlines and aircraft makers were adjusting plans amid uncertainty.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "The period after the investment began determined the result. Different companies recovered differently, and the broad baskets did not depend on one product or industry.",
    "what_faded_away": "An announced job cut did not reveal a company’s five-year stock return. A coming software launch did not either.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "Nobody had a map of the recovery or the future leaders. Seeing Apple’s eventual gain now can hide how uncertain its prospects were then.",
